name rubik
category Package
revision 46791
shortdesc Document Rubik cube configurations and rotation sequences
longdesc The bundle provides four packages: rubikcube provides commands
longdesc for typesetting Rubik cubes and their transformations,
longdesc rubiktwocube provides commands for typesetting Rubik twocubes
longdesc and their transformations, rubikrotation which can process a
longdesc sequence of Rubik rotation moves, with the help of a Perl
longdesc package executed via \write18 (shell escape) commands, and
longdesc rubikpatterns, a collection of well known patterns and their
longdesc associated rotation sequences.
depend rubik.ARCH
